ide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]而狭义的金弦之厅，指的就是那边的议事大厅，也是[color=ffb64d]三枝议会[colorEnd]召开大会、决定黑森林事宜的地方，可以说是黑森林的中枢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]等等，这名词也太多了吧？三枝又是什么？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]三枝指的就是部族联盟中的三大职责，分别是保卫森林的护林人、维持后勤的布宴者，还有指引未来的巨木侍女。森林中的一切事宜，都由三枝共同商议决定，其中又以巨木侍女为首。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_57"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"y\": -21.05,\r    \"time\": 3,\r    \"zoom\": 0.8,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"x\": 9.10\r  },\r  \"action\": \"cameraMove\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]三枝议会，就是由这三枝的领袖组成的议会。三枝的领袖，就是护林人的首领，树冠守望者——芭杜尔；而布宴者的首席，就是我啦，宴会大师嘉莉缇。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]至于巨木侍女的领袖，灵魂先知嘛……由于之前出了一点小问题，本应继任的灵魂先知突然失踪了。现在三枝议会首座由护林人的首领，也就是树冠守望者代理。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_56"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"pause\": true\r  },\r  \"action\": \"gamePause\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{